Bun Native native text input includes code adapted from:
Zed GPUI, crates/gpui/examples/input.rs
https://github.com/zed-industries/zed/blob/ba63a022c9a22ca66d68ef2a8f0bb9b5b0a9984d/crates/gpui/examples/input.rs
