Bun Native changes: bounded text, command-driven value updates, bounded event
channel, source split by editing versus paint, and input key bindings.

Bun Native's bounded X11 authority parser adapts x11rb-protocol 0.13.2:
https://github.com/psychon/x11rb/blob/1b73245acc5dce4c4987c80dd7589e7b60af3532/x11rb-protocol/src/xauth.rs
Copyright 2019 x11rb Contributers. Licensed under the MIT license, retained in
LICENSE-MIT-x11rb. Matching follows the pinned parser; Bun Native reads one
nonblocking-opened, size-checked regular file and rejects truncated entries.
